</ul></nav></section><section class="front-matter"><div class="ameta p font-secondary font-xs">
<hgroup><h1>Volcanogenic Pseudo-Fossils from the ∼3.48 Ga Dresser Formation, Pilbara, Western Australia</h1></hgroup><div class="cg p">
<a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Wacey%20D"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id1"><span class="name western">David Wacey</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id1">
<h3><span class="name western">David Wacey</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup><sup>1</sup></sup>Centre for Microscopy Characterisation and Analysis, The University of Western Australia, Perth, Australia.</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Wacey%20D"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">David Wacey</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>1,</sup><sup>✉</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Noffke%20N"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id2"><span class="name western">Nora Noffke</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id2">
<h3><span class="name western">Nora Noffke</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup><sup>2</sup></sup>Department of Ocean, Earth and Atmospheric Sciences, Old Dominion University, Norfolk, Virginia, USA.</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Noffke%20N"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Nora Noffke</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>2</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Saunders%20M"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id3"><span class="name western">Martin Saunders</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id3">
<h3><span class="name western">Martin Saunders</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup><sup>1</sup></sup>Centre for Microscopy Characterisation and Analysis, The University of Western Australia, Perth, Australia.</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Saunders%20M"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Martin Saunders</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>1</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Guagliardo%20P"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id4"><span class="name western">Paul Guagliardo</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id4">
<h3><span class="name western">Paul Guagliardo</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup><sup>1</sup></sup>Centre for Microscopy Characterisation and Analysis, The University of Western Australia, Perth, Australia.</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Guagliardo%20P"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Paul Guagliardo</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>1</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Pyle%20DM"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id5"><span class="name western">David M Pyle</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id5">
<h3><span class="name western">David M Pyle</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup><sup>3</sup></sup>Department of Earth Sciences, University of Oxford, Oxford, UK.</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Pyle%20DM"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">David M Pyle</span></a>
