<p>The authors acknowledge the facilities, scientific and technical assistance of the AMMRF at the Centre for Microscopy Characterisation and Analysis, The University of Western Australia, and the Electron Microscopy Unit at the University of New South Wales. These facilities are funded by the Universities, State and Commonwealth Governments. We thank Ron Kelley from Thermo Fisher Scientific for the collection of the 3D FIB-SEM data set at the FEI Hillsboro Nanoport, and Bertrand Ligouis for provision of the image for <a href="#f4" class="usa-link">Fig. 4n</a>. Martin Brasier is thanked for insightful discussions in the early stages of this work. D.W. is funded by the Australian Research Council via a Future Fellowship grant (FT 140100321). We thank Sherry Cady and three anonymous reviewers for comments that improved this manuscript.</p></section><section id="s018"><h2 class="pmc_sec_title">Author Disclosure Statement</h2>
